 13, "prompt": "\nThe family needs to appreciate that …………………………..……………………changes must occur in children\nwhose weight exceeds what is healthy.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 802, "answer": {"text": "Long-term", "source": {"id": "offline-d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00", "filename": "A-answers.docx", "sha256": "d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00761ebd9fc435580eab3d30a8212eaec8963b948037df", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00761ebd9fc435580eab3d30a8212eaec8963b948037df.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00761ebd9fc435580eab3d30a8212eaec8963b948037df.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 14, "prompt": "\nWhat influences the type of chart used to calculate a child's growth status?\nAnswer: …………………………..…………………………", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 1102, "answer": {"text": "Age and gender", "source": {"id": "offline-d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00", "filename": "A-answers.docx", "sha256": "d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00761ebd9fc435580eab3d30a8212eaec8963b948037df", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00761ebd9fc435580eab3d30a8212eaec8963b948037df.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00761ebd9fc435580eab3d30a8212eaec8963b948037df.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 15, "prompt": "\nWhat does the WHO and CDC assess and monitor when forming childhood growth charts?\nAnswer: …………………………..…………………………", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "Weight, length/height and BMI", "source": {"id": "offline-d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00", "filename": "A-answers.docx", "sha256": "d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00761ebd9fc435580eab3d30a8212eaec8963b948037df", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/d6c6e67c32d278cf0f00761ebd9fc435